WEBVTT

00:14:24.287 --> 00:14:30.162
I think, for example, about messenger
RNA technology, which was seen as,

00:14:30.246 --> 00:14:32.704
I think a joke for a long time,

00:14:32.704 --> 00:14:35.746
and if not for the courage
and tenacity of

00:14:35.746 --> 00:14:38.371
a small group of scientists who
persisted with it anyway,

00:14:38.662 --> 00:14:41.454
we might not have a covert
vaccine right now. Oh.

00:14:44.371 --> 00:14:50.246
I think well, in the first place, science,
like many other social systems,

00:14:51.704 --> 00:14:54.954
doesn't thrive on everybody
being the same.

00:14:55.454 --> 00:14:59.579
So you may have some advice that
is good for some people.

00:14:59.829 --> 00:15:05.704
And it's clear that some people who are
irrationally persistent achieved great